{"originalLanguage":"ko","title":"야생화","artist":"박효신","date":"2026-09-08","sourceId":"15101264:014","sourceHash":"5a1239141ff942adddfa26e1f745f5db7dc8651a2a9a414021a236ee37e9c357","duration":148.1,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":7.35,"end":13.14,"text":"한줄기 햇살에 몸 녹이다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":14.74,"end":20.743,"text":"그렇게 너는 또 한번 내게 온다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":24.15,"end":30.199,"text":"좋았던 기억만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":30.43,"end":36.63,"text":"그리운 마음만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":37.33,"end":42.03,"text":"니가 떠나간 그 길 위에","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":42.07,"end":47.61,"text":"이렇게 남아 서있다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":48.31,"end":53.31,"text":"잊혀질 만큼만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":53.35,"end":59.567,"text":"괜찮을 만큼만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":59.74,"end":65.615,"text":"눈물 머금고 기다린 떨림 끝에","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":66.5,"end":72.649,"text":"다시 나를 피우리라","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":79.77,"end":85.886,"text":"사랑은 피고 또 지는 타버리는 불꽃","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":100.68,"end":106.943,"text":"빗물에 젖을까 두 눈을 감는다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}